  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 602.01 References. For the purpose of this chapter, unless otherwise specified all references to 40 CFR 51, 40 CFR 52, 40 CFR 70, 40 CFR 72, 40 CFR 73, 40 CFR 76, and 40 CFR 78 shall be to the July 1, 2011 edition.\n\nSource. #1375, eff 7-1-79; ss by #1717, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss by #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03; ss by #8129, eff 7-28-04; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
